{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "错误的道歉方式概述", "content": "父母常见的认错方式中，有些方式是错误的。使用这些方式认错，会导致孩子越来越恨父母，亲子关系越来越糟糕，甚至感觉不如不认错。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["道歉", "亲子关系", "错误方式"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00002"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "第一种错误道歉方式：用行为代替言语道歉", "content": "第一种错误道歉方式是父母不直接口头认错，而是通过间接行为表达歉意，例如做一顿饭、铺被子、买衣服、送礼物、给零花钱等，但不直接说出口。父母可能觉得小事郑重其事认错很奇怪，也可能不懂如何直接道歉。这种间接方式在孩子心中不算道歉。", "steps": [], "conditions": ["父母觉得小事郑重其事认错很奇怪", "父母不懂如何直接道歉"], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["道歉", "间接行为", "错误方式"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00003", "b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00003", "b00004", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用行为代替言语道歉时", "reason": "父母用行为代替言语道歉会导致孩子积怨，即用行为代替道歉是孩子积怨的原因，故该后果得到源端支持。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原关系为causes，按允许类型改为supports。"}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a005", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用行为代替言语道歉时", "reason": "父母用行为代替言语道歉会导致孩子向父母隐藏情绪，故该后果得到源端支持。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原关系为causes，按允许类型改为supports。"}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用行为代替言语道歉时", "reason": "父母用行为代替言语道歉会导致孩子对人际关系不感兴趣，故该后果得到源端支持。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原关系为causes，按允许类型改为supports。"}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:r001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用行为代替道歉时", "reason": "父母用行为代替道歉会导致孩子猜测且得不到明确答案，故该后果得到源端支持。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原关系为causes，按允许类型改为supports。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "丈夫用珠宝代替道歉的案例", "content": "一对夫妻接受辅导，妻子坚决要离婚。妻子等到孩子考上大学才提出离婚。婚姻持续20年，其中妻子在过去15年里出轨三次，丈夫毫不知情。丈夫以为日子过得很好，但妻子说丈夫从来没有道过歉，丈夫反驳说每次吵架或犯错后都会买昂贵的钻石或珠宝作为道歉。妻子回应说“可是你从来没有对我道过歉”。丈夫表情困惑，不理解为什么买了珠宝还不算道歉。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["道歉", "案例", "夫妻关系", "间接行为"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006", "b00007", "b00008", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a002", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "丈夫用珠宝代替道歉", "reason": "丈夫用珠宝代替道歉的案例是用行为代替言语道歉这一错误道歉方式的实例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "legacy:xg-ca-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：犯错后用物质礼物代替口头道歉；婚姻关系长期未进行言语道歉导致积怨。", "reason": "候选描述了同一案例，补充了妻子出轨三次、丈夫不知情及丈夫困惑等背景细节，但未包含旧原子“间接行为代替口头道歉”的条件和“物质补偿不能替代”的限制。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "用行为代替道歉的后果：孩子积怨", "content": "用行为代替言语道歉的第一个后果是孩子会对父母产生深深的积怨。积怨是指没有说出来的、压抑在心里的愤怒。孩子愤怒的原因是父母做错了却不道歉，企图用物质来购买原谅，这本身让孩子愤怒。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["积怨", "愤怒", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a016", "kind": "supports", "condition": "积怨的定义", "reason": "记录a004提到积怨，a016给出积怨的定义，支持理解。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a016", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0005", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0005", "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "用行为代替道歉的后果：孩子隐藏情绪", "content": "用行为代替道歉的第二个后果是孩子会对父母隐藏情绪。因为父母用物质转移注意力，不想谈论事情本身和深层情绪，孩子学到父母不愿意谈深层情绪，于是以后所有情绪都会向父母隐藏。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["隐藏情绪", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "用行为代替道歉的后果：孩子对人际关系不感兴趣", "content": "用行为代替道歉的第三个后果是孩子对人际关系非常不感兴趣。亲子关系在血缘上是真实的，但在情感上会变得表面和虚假。孩子从未体验过在亲密关系中安全地坦露和深层次交流，所以觉得人际交往烦人且肤浅，转而喜欢打游戏和上网。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["人际关系", "亲密关系", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00014", "b00015", "b00016", "b00017", "b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "第二种错误道歉方式：一句话道歉", "content": "第二种错误道歉方式是父母口头道歉，但只说一句“对不起，我错了”或最多加一句“请原谅我”，例如说“我今天打了你，我不打了，我们和好吧”，然后就结束，不深入讨论伤害和情绪。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["道歉", "一句话道歉", "错误方式"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00018", "b00021"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a008", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用一句话道歉时", "reason": "a007描述一句话道歉的具体方式，a008说明这种方式带来的第一个后果是孩子内心情绪矛盾，因此a007是a008所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a009", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用一句话道歉时", "reason": "a007描述一句话道歉的具体方式，a009说明这种方式带来的第二个后果是孩子对情绪感到困惑，因此a007是a009所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a010", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用一句话道歉时", "reason": "a007描述一句话道歉的具体方式，a010说明这种方式带来的第三个后果是孩子学会空洞道歉，因此a007是a010所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:r002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用一句话道歉时", "reason": "a007描述一句话道歉的具体方式，r002说明一句话道歉使孩子无法指认情绪，因此a007是r002所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-06", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：父母口头道歉时；两处均描述一句话道歉的粗糙。", "reason": "legacy 中“一句话粗糙”与候选“一句话道歉”定义一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "一句话道歉的后果：孩子内心情绪矛盾", "content": "一句话道歉的第一个后果是孩子内心对自己的情绪充满矛盾。孩子对父母仍有愤怒，但又觉得应该原谅，因为父母已经道歉了，而且孩子处于被动依赖地位，只能口头说原谅，愤怒被压抑。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪矛盾", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00019", "b00020", "b00021"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "一句话道歉的后果：孩子对情绪感到困惑", "content": "一句话道歉的第二个后果是孩子对情绪感到极度困惑。因为孩子没有机会指认和表达自己的情绪，多种情绪（伤心、委屈、愤怒、难过、无能为力）搅在一起，无法健康表达情绪，以后可能在被伤害时怀疑是自己的错。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪困惑", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:r002", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0012", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "一句话道歉的后果：孩子学会空洞道歉", "content": "一句话道歉的第三个后果是孩子以后也不会真正道歉，会模仿父母的方式，说一句空洞的“我错了”就完事，对别人道歉也是如此，道歉流于形式。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["道歉", "模仿", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00024"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "第三种错误道歉方式：流氓式道歉", "content": "第三种错误道歉方式是“流氓式道歉”，即先承认错误，但话锋一转，把错误归咎于对方，例如“我不该打你，但是是你气得我没办法”；也像孩子说“我没考好，是因为你没给我请私人家教”，把责任全部推给对方。这种道歉方式危害最大。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["道歉", "流氓式道歉", "错误方式"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00025", "b00026"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a012", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用流氓式道歉时", "reason": "a011描述流氓式道歉的具体方式，a012说明这种方式带来的第一个后果是孩子鄙视父母，因此a011是a012所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a013", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用流氓式道歉时", "reason": "a011描述流氓式道歉的具体方式，a013说明这种方式带来的第二个后果是孩子感觉被背叛，因此a011是a013所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a014", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用流氓式道歉时", "reason": "a011描述流氓式道歉的具体方式，a014说明这种方式带来的第三个后果是孩子与父母断联，因此a011是a014所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:r003", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当父母用流氓式道歉时", "reason": "a011描述流氓式道歉的具体方式，r003说明流氓式道歉导致孩子不再信任父母，因此a011是r003所描述后果的原因。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-06", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：道歉但转而指责孩子；两处均描述流氓式道歉。", "reason": "legacy 中“带但是的流氓式”与候选“流氓式道歉”定义一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-a-02", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：均涉及先认错后归咎对方的流氓式道歉；区别：候选补充具体例句并指出危害最大。", "reason": "候选提供更详细说明。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "流氓式道歉的后果：孩子鄙视父母", "content": "流氓式道歉的第一个后果是孩子会极度鄙视父母。因为父母不敢大方承认错误，反而找借口，孩子觉得父母是伪君子，一方面教导孩子知错认错不找借口，另一方面自己却找理由。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["鄙视", "伪君子", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00026", "b00027", "b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "流氓式道歉的后果：孩子感觉被背叛", "content": "流氓式道歉的第二个后果是孩子会感觉被背叛。孩子愿意坐下来听父母说话是出于信任和期待，但父母道歉后转而指责孩子，孩子觉得自己上当受骗，感到被二次伤害，并后悔再次信任父母。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["背叛", "信任", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00028", "b00029", "b00030", "b00031"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a017", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "孩子愿意谈话是恩典，但流氓式道歉导致背叛", "reason": "a017说明孩子愿意谈话是给父母的恩典，a013说明流氓式道歉让孩子感觉被背叛，形成对比。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：流氓式道歉后；legacy 泛指错误道歉造成二次伤害，候选具体到被背叛感。", "reason": "补充流氓式道歉的具体后果细节。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-a-02", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：均涉及这种道歉造成二次伤害；区别：候选详述孩子感到被背叛、后悔再次信任。", "reason": "候选补充后果层面。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "流氓式道歉的后果：孩子与父母断联", "content": "流氓式道歉的第三个后果是孩子与父母断联，变得漠然并封闭自己。孩子经历背叛后，不再与父母进行情绪连接，把自己包裹起来，避免再次受伤害，表现为拒绝沟通、沉迷游戏或与朋友聊天而不理父母。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["断联", "封闭", "道歉", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["心理诊断"], "id": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b2b900e0045d", "blocks": ["b00031", "b00032", "b00033"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:r003", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0018", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b2b900e0045d-c001:u0018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
